  "raw_label": "1",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Nisar Ahmed Babulal Aralimatti vs The State Of Maharashtra on 25 April, 2024 Author: N.J.Jamadar Bench: N.J.Jamadar 909 aba 1091 of 202 In The High Court Of Judicature At Bombay Criminal Appellate Jurisdiction Anticipatory Bail Application No.1091 Of 2024 Nisar Ahmed Babulal Aralimatti ... Applicant versus The State of Maharashtra ... Respondent Mr. Chaitanya Pendse i/by Ms. Siddhi Bhosale, for Applicant. Mrs. Ranjana Humane, App for State. Coram: N.J.Jamadar, J. Date : 25 April 2024 P.C. 1. 2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with CR No.110 of 2024 registered with Supa Police Station, Baramati, Pune, for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (\"the Penal Code\") and Sections 26(2)(i), 3(1)(zz)(iv), 59, 27(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006.",
    "facts": "2. This is an application for pre-arrest bail in connection with CR No.110 of 2024 registered with Supa Police Station, Baramati, Pune, for the offences punishable under Sections 328, 188, 272 of Indian Penal Code, 1860 (\"the Penal Code\") and Sections 26(2)(i), 3(1)(zz)(iv), 59, 27(2)(iv), 27(3)(d), 27(3)(e) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. 3. The applicant apprehends arrest in connection with the aforesaid crime as the co-accused in whose possession the contraband articles - Gutakha Pan masala, has been seized, has named the applicant as the person privy to the offences.",
